    "zh": "黑蓝单电版配无刷电机、光流定位、四面避障和收纳包，标称飞行约15分钟。",
    "en": "A black-and-blue single-battery drone with brushless motors, optical flow, four-side obstacle avoidance and a carrying case; stated flight time is about 15 minutes."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "黑蓝单电版配无刷电机、光流定位、四面避障和收纳包，标称飞行约15分钟。",
      "套装为单电池版本，机身电池3.7 V、2000 mAh，配彩盒和收纳包。",
      "资料列遥控距离约40–50 m、飞行约15分钟、充电约60–80分钟；图像跟随和手势拍照识别距离约1–3 m。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "A black-and-blue single-battery drone with brushless motors, optical flow, four-side obstacle avoidance and a carrying case; stated flight time is about 15 minutes.",
      "This is a single-battery version with a 3.7 V, 2,000 mAh drone battery, color box and carrying case.",
      "The source lists a control range of about 40–50 m, flight time about 15 minutes and charging about 60–80 minutes."
    ]
  },
